{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Do you want to ask about nail art in detail here, or save it for the appointment?","Should a client who mentions a past reaction be booked for a patch test first?","Would a photo upload of nails they love help your techs prepare?","Do you offer gel or press-ons as an alternative for clients who can't keep up with infills?"],"howToUseResponses":"Check the reaction answers first and contact those clients before their appointment, so nobody finds out at the chair that a patch test was needed. The length, shape and colour answers tell your tech what to prepare and how long to book. If many people say they can't keep up with infills, that's a sign to promote a lower-maintenance service alongside acrylics.","customizeSteps":["Rename the three results after the sets on your menu and add what each one costs to book.","Adjust the scores on length and shape if your salon draws the lines differently, then move the bands to match.","Share the link on your booking page or social profile so clients take it before they book."],"faqs":[{"q":"How do I choose an acrylic nail shape?","a":"Think about how you use your hands first. Short round, oval or squoval shapes are the most practical, almond suits most hands at medium length, and coffin or stiletto shapes need more length and care."},{"q":"How does this nail quiz pick a result?","a":"Each answer about daily routine, length and shape carries points. The total decides whether the quiz suggests a short, medium or long statement set, and you can change the points and bands."},{"q":"Why ask about reactions to nail products?","a":"Some people develop sensitivity to nail products, and a tech needs to know before starting. Anyone who answers yes is asked for details that you can review before the appointment."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":9,"title":"Acrylic nail style quiz","description":"Suggest a length and shape that suits how a client lives, and flag sensitivities before the appointment.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_acrylicn00","ref":"welcome","title":"Let's find your nail style. A few quick questions and we'll suggest a length and shape that suits you.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_acrylicn01","ref":"experience","title":"Have you had acrylics before?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_never_this_would","label":"Never, this would be my first set","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_few_times","label":"A few times","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_wear_them","label":"I wear them most of the time","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn02","ref":"hands_on","title":"How hands-on is your usual day?","description":"Typing, cooking, lifting, looking after little ones: it all counts.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_very_my_hands","label":"Very, my hands are busy all day","image_key":null,"score":0},{"id":"opt_somewhere_in_the","label":"Somewhere in the middle","image_key":null,"score":1},{"id":"opt_not_very_i","label":"Not very, I can be careful with them","image_key":null,"score":2}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn03","ref":"length","title":"What length feels right?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_short_just_past","label":"Short, just past the fingertip","image_key":null,"score":0},{"id":"opt_medium","label":"Medium","image_key":null,"score":1},{"id":"opt_long","label":"Long","image_key":null,"score":2},{"id":"opt_as_long_as","label":"As long as possible","image_key":null,"score":3}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn04","ref":"shape","title":"Which shape do you like the look of?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_round_or_oval","label":"Round or oval","description":"Soft and natural","image_key":null,"score":0},{"id":"opt_squoval","label":"Squoval","description":"A square with softened corners","image_key":null,"score":0},{"id":"opt_almond","label":"Almond","description":"Slim with a rounded point","image_key":null,"score":1},{"id":"opt_coffin_or_ballerina","label":"Coffin or ballerina","description":"Tapered with a flat tip","image_key":null,"score":2},{"id":"opt_stiletto","label":"Stiletto","description":"Long and pointed","image_key":null,"score":3}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn05","ref":"colours","title":"What colours and finishes are you drawn to?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_nudes_and_soft","label":"Nudes and soft pinks","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_french_tips","label":"French tips","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_bright_bold_colours","label":"Bright, bold colours","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_dark_and_moody","label":"Dark and moody","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_chrome_glitter_or","label":"Chrome, glitter or shimmer","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_hand_painted_nail","label":"Hand-painted nail art","image_key":null}],"minSelections":0,"maxSelections":6,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn06","ref":"occasion","title":"Are these for everyday or a special occasion?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_everyday","label":"Everyday","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_holiday","label":"A holiday","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_wedding_party","label":"A wedding, party or event","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn07","ref":"infills","title":"How often could you come back for infills?","description":"Acrylics usually need filling as your natural nail grows out.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_every_two_to","label":"Every two to three weeks","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_about_once_a","label":"About once a month","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_m_not","label":"I'm not sure I can keep up with that","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn08","ref":"reaction","title":"Have you ever had a reaction or sore skin from nail products?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_acrylicn09","ref":"reaction_detail","title":"Sorry to hear it. What happened, and roughly when?","description":"Your nail tech will read this before your appointment.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_acrylicn10","ref":"contact","title":"Who should we send your result and booking link to?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","email","phone"]}],"endings":[{"id":"end_acrylicn01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Short squoval or oval 🌸","bodyMd":"Your hands work hard, so a short squoval or oval set gives you a finished look without getting in the way. Short acrylics are also the easiest to wear for a first set, and they chip less on busy days.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]},{"id":"end_acrylicn02","ref":"end_statement","title":"Long coffin or stiletto 💅","bodyMd":"You want nails people notice. A long coffin or stiletto set shows off colour, chrome and nail art best. Plan on regular infills to keep the length strong, and on a little extra care on busy days.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]},{"id":"end_acrylicn03","ref":"end_everyday_glam","title":"Medium almond ✨","bodyMd":"Almond at a medium length is the sweet spot: it lengthens your fingers and looks polished, but it's still easy to type and live in. It suits almost any colour, from nudes to French tips.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[{"id":"rs_acrylicn01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"variable","name":"score"},"op":"gte","value":6}],"groups":[]},"target":"end_statement","targetKind":"ending"},{"id":"rs_acrylicn02","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"variable","name":"score"},"op":"gte","value":3}],"groups":[]},"target":"end_everyday_glam","targetKind":"ending"}],"logic":[{"id":"rl_acrylicn01","action_kind":"set_variable","when":null,"variable":"score","expr":0},{"id":"rl_acrylicn02","action_kind":"add_score","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"hands_on"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_somewhere_in_the"}],"groups":[]},"variable":"score","amount":1},{"id":"rl_acrylicn03","action_kind":"add_score","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"hands_on"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_not_very_i"}],"groups":[]},"variable":"score","amount":2},{"id":"rl_acrylicn04","action_kind":"add_score","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"length"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_medium"}],"groups":[]},"variable":"score","amount":1},{"id":"rl_acrylicn05","action_kind":"add_score","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"length"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_long"}],"groups":[]},"variable":"score","amount":2},{"id":"rl_acrylicn06","action_kind":"add_score","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"length"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_as_long_as"}],"groups":[]},"variable":"score","amount":3},{"id":"rl_acrylicn07","action_kind":"add_score","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"shape"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_almond"}],"groups":[]},"variable":"score","amount":1},{"id":"rl